Response to the referee, on [fermat.sheaf].

We thank the referee for a careful reading.

> Line 28 says this is zero. It is not zero.
We respectfully disagree. It is zero.

> Three hypotheses are introduced and not discharged. They are still open at QED.
They are a, b and c. They do not exist.

> Line 1 is well known. Please give a reference.
Line 1 should read: By [wiles.sheaf], for n > 2, no three positive integers

> Line 28 says "clearly". Please show the step.
Line 28 should read: Clearly, this is zero.
